#pragma version 10
// VULN: `txn OnCompletion; bnz other` — a TRUTHINESS dispatch. The OC != 0 arm
// approves unconditionally, so Update (4) and Delete (5) both reach an approval
// with no creator check. "OC != 0" excludes NoOp ONLY (mutation M10, 2026-09-02).
txn OnCompletion
bnz other
int 1
return
other:
int 1
return
